/T (EcoFiber BD manufactures, supplies and exports raw banana fiber, recovered from the pseudostems left behind by Bangladesh's banana harvest. Beyond raw graded fiber, we craft our own range of banana-fiber handicrafts, turning what was once discarded plant material into export-ready material and finished goods for buyers across the globe.)
